Package: multiomeRCore
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Runtime Helpers for multiomeR Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Thomas", "Gade Koefoed", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "thomas.gade.koefoed@sund.ku.dk")
Description: A small collection of general process, resource, and structured
    output helpers used by multiomeR and related targets pipelines. The
    multiomeR pipeline sources the package R files directly so its users can
    edit them as ordinary workflow code, while external workflows can install
    the same files as a versioned package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    fs,
    magrittr,
    processx,
    purrr,
    stringr,
    targets
Suggests:
    crew,
    ggplot2,
    ragg,
    svglite
